---
description: Player types handling
globs: *.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
Use following helper functions to narrow-down alt.Player type from altv/src/server/core/utility/assertions.ts
`export function needsToBeInGame(player: alt.Player): asserts player is InGamePlayer`
`export function isInGame(player: alt.Player): player is InGamePlayer`

These function acts as a type guard that narrows player to InGamePlayer type, which guarantees access to character, gameState, and other properties.

Do not check player.valid or !player for player-validity, usually using isInGame is the best approach.
